  "user_request_original": "Design a broadband anti-reflection coating on silicon substrate. Incident medium: air. Substrate: semi-infinite si. Coating stack: Ta2O5 (Gao) | SiO2 (Lemarchand) | Ta2O5 (Gao) | SiO2 (Lemarchand) | Ta2O5 (Gao) | SiO2 (Lemarchand) | Ta2O5 (Gao) | SiO2 (Lemarchand) | Ta2O5 (Gao) | SiO2 (Lemarchand) (10 layers, 5 pairs). Wavelength range: continuous 1260-1565 nm with band-specific reporting for 1260-1360 nm and 1530-1565 nm. Incidence: 0 deg, unpolarized. Optimize all 10 layer thicknesses independently within 20-400 nm range. Objective: minimize average reflectance across continuous 1260-1565 nm range. Report best_target_score, valid_candidates, tightest_margin, thicknesses_nm, and band-specific average reflectance and transmittance into silicon.",
